// Per-scene beat lists. "ZONE@sec" = a 3s cut of that zone's source starting there (seconds, not mm:ss).
// Generated by gen-plan.mjs from content-checked zones (see zone_*.jpg contact sheets) so beats never
// overlap and nothing repeats. Beat count per scene = ceil(mountedFrames / 90).
