// Zone -> source file:
//   RC_* = race.mp4      Tokyo Aquatics Centre, women's 50 fly FINAL, 25 Sep 2026 (the core footage)
//     REC records board (WR Sjoestroem 24.43 / AR+GR Zhang 25.05,25.10)  SL start list  PREP blocks prep
//     RACE the swim + finish + celebration   RES results board (all 3 names+times)
//   PD_* = podium.mp4     50 fly medal ceremony (WALK walk-out incl. "ZHANG YUFEI" cap close-up, CER medal presentation, END closing)
//   RL_* = relay.mp4      women's 4x100 medley relay (SL start list, PREP walkouts, RACE the swim, FIN finish/hugs)
//   CR_* = cer.mp4        relay victory ceremony (WALK, CER medal presentation, END closing)
//   N5_* = nat25.mp4      15th China National Games, Nov 2025, women's 50 fly (REC records board, LINE athlete intros, RACE blocks+race+results, FIN finish/medal)
//   JK_* = jkt18.mp4      Jakarta 2018 Asian Games, Zhang vs Ikee 100 fly (ID start list w/ ZHANG name, RACE + lane graphic, CER medal tally)
//   FK_* = fuk23.mp4      Fukuoka 2023 Worlds, Zhang's PB 25.05 (INTRO walkouts/name cards, SL start list w/ Yufei ZHANG, RACE the swim, RES results board)
//   TR_* = tok20relay.mp4 Tokyo 2020 4x200 free relay medal ceremony/parade (TEAMS start list, CHINA the PRC team on screen)
//   ZZ   = zzs200.mp4     Zhang Zhanshuo 200 free (from zhang2-short, identity already verified there)
//   YZ   = yzfly.mp4      Yu Zidi 200 fly (from yuzidi5-short, identity already verified there)
